        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 422.73,
          "end": 424.5,
          "en": "So that's really useful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 424.5,
          "end": 425.82,
          "en": "But back to our code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 425.82,
          "end": 427.41,
          "en": "Now let's dive into filter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 427.41,
          "end": 429.12,
          "en": "And if we wanted to add that too",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 429.12,
          "end": 431.88,
          "en": "we would simply add it here, separate by a comma",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 431.88,
          "end": 434.79,
          "en": "in front of map as an extra argument here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 434.79,
          "end": 438.033,
          "en": "and filter all that gets the data of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 441.63,
          "end": 443.1,
          "en": "And inside of that anonymous function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 443.1,
          "end": 445.92,
          "en": "which we pass to filter, where we do get that data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 445.92,
          "end": 449.4,
          "en": "we now have to return true or false, which decides",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 449.4,
          "end": 452.94,
          "en": "whether that data point will continue in that chain.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 452.94,
          "end": 454.5,
          "en": "So whether it will reach map",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 454.5,
          "end": 458.13,
          "en": "and thereafter subscription or whether it will be dropped",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 458.13,
          "end": 462.78,
          "en": "in which case it will never reach map nor the subscription.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 462.78,
          "end": 465.24,
          "en": "Now of course we could hard code true or false here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 465.24,
          "end": 467.82,
          "en": "but that's not too useful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 467.82,
          "end": 470.31,
          "en": "Instead we could say, \"Yeah return true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 470.31,
          "end": 472.56,
          "en": "if data is greater than zero.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 472.56,
          "end": 476.07,
          "en": "And that effectively means that we will return every value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 476.07,
          "end": 477.84000000000003,
          "en": "But the very first one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 477.84000000000003,
          "end": 480.42,
          "en": "and therefore instance we bridge round data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 480.42,
          "end": 482.16,
          "en": "plus one will not start",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 482.16,
          "end": 485.55,
          "en": "with round one because we're dropping this zero value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 485.55,
          "end": 488.13,
          "en": "Instead we'll actually start with round two.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 488.13,
          "end": 491.01,
          "en": "Cause only then this condition is true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 491.01,
          "end": 494.82,
          "en": "So if we now go back to our application here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 494.82,
          "end": 498.78,
          "en": "let this reload, we see nothing, but then round two",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 498.78,
          "end": 499.74,
          "en": "round three and so on,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 499.74,
          "end": 502.32,
          "en": "so round one, indeed is skipped",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 502.32,
          "end": 504.57,
          "en": "and that shows you hopefully the power",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 504.57,
          "end": 507.81,
          "en": "of operators that they allow you to build up a chain",
